                <pb facs="0301" n="236" sameAs="frus:frus1936v03/pg236"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">765.84/4479: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Gibson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-05-21T11:00:00-03:00">May 21, 1936—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received May 21—9:40 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>128. Foreign Office would appreciate information as to character of reply
                    Department contemplates making to circular communication from Italian Government
                    announcing annexation of Abyssinia.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gibson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
